on-colors\">Minimal solitaire ring </h3><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold mt-0.5\">₹<!-- -->399</p></div></a></div><div class=\"mt-12 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-foreground/15 px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-foreground/5 hover:border-foreground/30 transition-all\" href=\"/shop\">View Full Catalog</a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 border-b border-border bg-border/5\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[3/4] w-full max-w-[420px] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-border/20 border border-border/40 shadow-sm\"><img src=\"/images/thaarakamintro.jpeg\" alt=\"Face of Thaarakam\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover object-center animate-fadeIn\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-secondary\">Face of Thaarakam</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl leading-tight\">Thaarakam is a big dream.<br/>And every tiny detail is a big effort.</h2></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary max-w-xl\">What started as a quiet dream is now our everyday commitment. From sketches and samples to sourcing and setting, every step is taken with care, patience, and purpose — to create pieces that feel just right.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 mt-4\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-background p-2.5 border border-border text-foreground flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 stroke-[1.8]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\">Carefully Handpicked</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-lg\">We personally handpick every product, for its design, quality, and the way it makes you feel.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-background p-2.5 border border-border text-foreground flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gem h-4 w-4 stroke-[1.8]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.5 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-2.5-6\"></path><path d=\"M17 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.6.8l3 4a2 2 0 0 1 .013 2.382l-7.99 10.986a2 2 0 0 1-3.247 0l-7.99-10.986A2 2 0 0 1 2.4 7.8l2.998-3.997A2 2 0 0 1 7 3z\"></path><path d=\"M2 9h20\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\">Quality You Can Trust</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-lg\">We never compromise on quality. Our jewelry is crafted using durable, skin-friendly materials that are made to last and made for everyday wear.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-background p-2.5 border border-border text-foreground flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 stroke-[1.8]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\">Made For You</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-lg\">Lightweight, timeless, and versatile — our pieces are designed to be with you in every room, at every hour, of your life.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-border/80 max-w-xl\"><p class=\"text-xs italic font-semibold text-foreground\">Thaarakam is more than jewelry. It&#x27;s our dream, our effort, and our promise to you.</p></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-border bg-background mt-auto\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-block\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-foreground\">THAARAKAM</span></a><p class=\"max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary\">Premium, elegant, and minimal fine jewellery curated for modern sophistication. Simple booking, delivered to your door.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-1\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thaarakam_by_nithara\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-xs text-secondary hover:text-foreground transition-all duration-200 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.315 2c2.43 0 2.784.008 3.885.058 1.012.046 1.724.207 2.2.39a4.121 4.121 0 011.51 1.04 4.08 4.08 0 011.04 1.51c.182.476.343 1.188.39 2.2.049 1.1.058 1.455.058 3.885 0 2.43-.008 2.784-.058 3.885-.046 1.012-.207 1.724-.39 2.2a4.121 4.121 0 01-1.04 1.51 4.08 4.08 0 01-1.51 1.04c-.476.182-1.188.343-2.2.39-1.1.049-1.455.058-3.885.058-2.43 0-2.784-.008-3.885-.058-1.012-.046-1.724-.207-2.2-.39a4.122 4.122 0 01-1.51-1.04 4.08 4.08 0 01-1.04-1.51c-.182-.476-.343-1.188-.39-2.2-.049-1.1-.058-1.455-.058-3.885 0-2.43